g=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">.&nbsp;</span>따라서 고해상도의 영화<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">,&nbsp;</span>게임을 하는데 적합한 해상도입니다<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20px !important;\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px; line-height: 20px !important;\"><font style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 248, 255); font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(41, 100, 224) !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"></span></font></font></font></p><div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">울트라HD [프로젝터]</p></div><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 248, 255); font-weight: inherit; color: rgb(41, 100, 224) !important; line-height: 20px !important;\">▼ 해상도 비교표</span></p><div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important;\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px;\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/22/21781_1_1395292785.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"97\